OL,3,AMeta fined $25bn for 'lies' over user
OL,4,Adata privacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company behind Facebook, Instagram
OL,7,Fand WhatsApp has been hit with another
OL,8,Fmassive fine for its business
OL,9,Fpractices.
OL,11,FA federal judge in New Mexico on
OL,12,FWednesday ordered Meta to pay $25bn
OL,13,F(#18.6bn) following a two week trial
OL,14,Fearlier this year that found it had for
OL,15,Fyears intentionally lied to the public
OL,16,Fabout the way it handled and controlled
OL,17,FFacebook user data.
OL,19,F"The lies extend beyond Facebook's data
OL,20,Fpractices as well," the judge said.
OL,21,Fadding it went to "the heart of its
OL,22,Fcore business practices."
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
